  (descr "SparkFun LoRa 1W Breakout 915MHz (SPX-18572, EBYTE E19-915M30S / SX1276), 1.5x2.0in board, two 1x9 0.1in headers 1.4in apart, 4x 3.3mm standoff holes. RP-SMA edge connector overhangs at -Y. Pads 1-9 = SparkFun J1 pins 1-9 (RXEN,TXEN,CS,SDI,SDO,SCK,3V3,5V,GND); pads 10-18 = J2 pins 1-9 (GND,D5,D4,D3,D2,D1,D0,RST,GND). Geometry from sparkfunX/LoRa_1W_Breakout Hardware/915MHz Eagle board.")
